    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Creates a criterion with field `Not include in evaluation` unchecked" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Create Criterion with Include in evaluation UNCHECKED</p>
            <p>Adds a new criteria category, then creates a criterion linked to it with "Include in evaluation" explicitly unchecked.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <step>Visit /settings/criteria-categories → Add category → Save.</step>
            <step>Visit /settings/criteria → Add criterion → set fields → uncheck includeInEvaluation → Save.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Criterion is created with includeInEvaluation unchecked; success message displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
            <chapter title="Notes">
                <note>Verifies the previously reported bug where the field might be saved as checked.</note>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
